{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Suitcase Stories</i> is a <strong>short, cozy puzzle game</strong> about life\u2019s little moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each suitcase you pack tells a story \u2014 from childhood to adulthood, every object carries a memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no timer, no score, no failure. Just the calm joy of arranging items until everything fits into place.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pack your suitcase</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag, drop, open and close compartments as you carefully fit every item inside. Each bag is a new chapter, reflecting a different stage of life.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974110/extras/6ca9888270d739b547aa4369b58342b6.poster.avif?t=1758555365\" width=1170 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974110/extras/6ca9888270d739b547aa4369b58342b6.webm?t=1758555365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover the memories</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From a kid\u2019s backpack to a work briefcase, from family trips to quiet retreats \u2014 every suitcase represents a meaningful transition. The objects you arrange are small fragments of those memories.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974110/extras/9f48cd3d41363399afcae6a3fc9a1266.poster.avif?t=1758555365\" width=1170 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974110/extras/9f48cd3d41363399afcae6a3fc9a1266.webm?t=1758555365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play at your own pace</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no rush. Take your time, enjoy the relaxing soundtrack, and find satisfaction in the moment when everything clicks into place.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What Suitcase Stories offers:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2\u20133 hours of cozy, contemplative play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 suitcases, 8 chapters of life</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 300 beautifully illustrated objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple and intuitive controls (mouse or gamepad)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing music and soft sound effects</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What Suitcase Stories does not offer:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hardcore puzzles or difficulty spikes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer or online features</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless replayability beyond its short, crafted journey</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Suitcase Stories</i> is meant to be a <strong>small but meaningful experience</strong> \u2014 a quiet pause to reflect, organize, and enjoy the simple act of seeing everything in its place.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3974110?t=1758555365","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974110/f3f689ff57c13c0a4f4a567274fc16124cbd4579/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758555365","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974110/ec28df62713e133e29558ec1b97c4c8fa96f98c2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758555365","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974110/ec28df62713e133e29558ec1b97c4c8fa96f98c2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758555365","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{